---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Who I am and what this site is about.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Hey — I'm Alex. By day I work with technology; by night I'm deep in the AI rabbit hole.
      This blog is my notebook for everything I find interesting across the AI landscape.
    </p>
    <p>Things I write about:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>LLMs</strong> — new model releases, prompt engineering, evaluation and tooling.</li>
      <li><strong>AI Agents</strong> — autonomous workflows, multi-agent systems, and agent frameworks.</li>
      <li><strong>AI Movies</strong> — how generative AI is changing filmmaking, from scripts to VFX.</li>
      <li><strong>AI Animation</strong> — experiments and tools for AI-generated animation.</li>
      <li><strong>AI Manga</strong> — the explosion of AI-assisted manga and webtoon creation.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If any of that sounds interesting, consider <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/subscribe`}>subscribing</a> —
      you'll get my latest posts in your inbox. No spam, ever.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
